        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A GAMEBOOK COME TO LIFE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This virtual gamebook blends the nostalgia of classic choose-your-own-adventure novels with modern interactive design. Flip through a richly designed 3D book, make meaningful choices, and shape the outcome of a branching narrative full of mystery, danger, and discovery. With no reflex-based gameplay, the experience focuses entirely on exploration, decision-making, and replayability. Expect multiple story paths, hidden secrets, and unique endings based on the choices you make. Whether you read through the tale in one sitting or revisit it to uncover every twist. The game contains a full gamebook, approximately 80000 words long. Perfect for fans of narrative games, visual novels, and interactive fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CLASSIC SCI-FI STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end of the 23rd century. Earth lies in the grip of a new Ice Age. Famine, cold and fanatic cults threaten what is left of civilization. Humanity is on the brink of extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine of the strongest heroes of the age come seeking the ultimate prize: the Heart of Volent, an object with the power to reshape reality. All are ruthless, powerful, determined. To succeed they must work together. But only one can have the Heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your alliances with care. Weigh up who to trust. Be ready for betrayal. When the moment comes, the future of mankind will rest on your judgement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A REIMAGINED ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where you control the unfolding narrative. In this interactive adventure, every choice you make shifts the story’s direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden &quot;Story Moments&quot;—exclusive scenes and key revelations that can only be uncovered by making the right choices.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A GAMEBOOK COME TO LIFE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This virtual gamebook blends the nostalgia of classic choose-your-own-adventure novels with modern interactive design. Flip through a richly designed 3D book, make meaningful choices, and shape the outcome of a branching narrative full of mystery, danger, and discovery. With no reflex-based gameplay, the experience focuses entirely on exploration, decision-making, and replayability. Expect multiple story paths, hidden secrets, and unique endings based on the choices you make. Whether you read through the tale in one sitting or revisit it to uncover every twist. The game contains a full gamebook, approximately 80000 words long. Perfect for fans of narrative games, visual novels, and interactive fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CLASSIC SCI-FI STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end of the 23rd century. Earth lies in the grip of a new Ice Age. Famine, cold and fanatic cults threaten what is left of civilization. Humanity is on the brink of extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nine of the strongest heroes of the age come seeking the ultimate prize: the Heart of Volent, an object with the power to reshape reality. All are ruthless, powerful, determined. To succeed they must work together. But only one can have the Heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your alliances with care. Weigh up who to trust. Be ready for betrayal. When the moment comes, the future of mankind will rest on your judgement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A REIMAGINED ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where you control the unfolding narrative. In this interactive adventure, every choice you make shifts the story’s direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hidden &quot;Story Moments&quot;—exclusive scenes and key revelations that can only be uncovered by making the right choices.</p>",
        "short_description": "A unique adventure, where every choice shapes your fate. A classic gamebook brought to life, with countless paths to discover.",
